<title>FINLAND: Benefon 1996 profit falls 56 percent.</title>
<headline>Benefon 1996 profit falls 56 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	   32.2  vs  73.8</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		    4.96 vs  11.87</p>
<p> Net sales					  284.4  vs 300.9</p>
<p> Operating profit				  27.8  vs  60.7</p>
<p> Profit from operations before depreciation 39.9 vs 70.8</p>
<p> Net profit					   24.7 vs 54.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish mobile phones maker is Benefon Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
